  (gr_text "ASSEMBLY\n1 DECK: BREAK OUT THE KNOCKOUT,\n  FILE THE NUBS FLUSH\n2 FACES TO DECK + END PLATE\n  FIRST, ON THE BARE BOARDS\n3 CLEAN (IPA)\n4 J1 + J2 ON THE BOTTOM,\n  THEN THE XIAOS\n5 RP-SMAS, COAX, TIE MOUNTS\n6 SPLITTER LEAD TO J2" (at 45.509618 104.901923 -240) (layer "F.SilkS") (tstamp 66e215fa-46bf-49b8-a1ff-4e368802be22)
